     "body": "<p>Odd, I don't get that error, but I can see why one might.  That said, it was incorrect before in that the referenced Node must have been assumed to be a javax.jcr.Node rather than a Jena Node.  I corrected it and Travis seems happy.  This is ready for re-review.</p>",
