  "description": "<p>This task is to ensure that URIs of versioned resources are exposed as their version label, not their JCR UUID.</p>\n\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>Create a binary resource in the HTML UI\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li><a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/image\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/image</a></li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>Create a version of that resource<br/>\ncurl -i -XPOST -H\"slug: v0\" <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/image/fcr:versions\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/image/fcr:versions</a> </li>\n\t<li>Get a listing of the resources versions<br/>\ncurl -i  <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/image/fcr:versions\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/image/fcr:versions</a>\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Notice the UUID of the versioned resource is returned in the listing</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n",
